    config USING_TF_PSA_CRYPTO
        bool
        default n
        select MCUX_COMPONENT_middleware.mbedtls.tf_psa_crypto
        help
            This config option is set to 'y' when TF PSA Crypto is selected
            as the caller of PSA Crypto Driver.

    config USING_MBEDTLS_3X
        bool
        default n
        select MCUX_COMPONENT_middleware.mbedtls3x.crypto
        help
            This config option is set to 'y' when Mbed TLS 3.x is selected
            as the caller of PSA Crypto Driver.

